      ],
      "notes": "Clamp the ends with the two example 02 toe clamps; inner edges at X -69 and +69 mm, outside X +/-62. Bolt clamps to the spoilboard with firm 12 mm packing under their outer ends; seat the bar on the spoilboard against the fixed end stop at X -80. At the M0 pause, flip end-for-end about Y, back against the stop, re-clamp. Keep the bar at the same XY position; use G55 for the second side. G55 only chamfers the three underside rims at mirrored centres; do not drill or bore again. These rims are accessible only after the flip.",
      "holdingMethod": "clamps"
    }
  ],
